id: GUIDE13-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: run_wide_guidance
target: crates/core/src/go_to.rs
find:     state.run.busy = None;
replace:     state.run.busy = None; state.run.guidance_level = fandhe_workshop_contract::guidance::GuidanceLevel::A;
expect-fail: guide13_goto_main_step_of_round1_chapter_keeps_b
note: 移動で案内レベルが既定の A へ戻る（実行全体で 1 つの水準を保たない）
